SUMMARY:Virgo Season Sun Circle 
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nJoin us for an intentional ritual for Vir
 go season\nWhen the sun moves into a new sign an energetic shift occurs. L
 earning to connect\, listen\, and set intentions with the sun is a beautif
 ul way to add ritual into your life.\nVirgo season is from 8/23 - 9/22 and
  for this gathering we'll discuss the Astrological happenings of the zodia
 c season and where it will impact you personally (birth chart recommended)
 .\nAs with all energetic shifts\, getting into your body is important. Tog
 ether we'll ground into the energy through meditation and movement themed 
 around the season. Accommodations/Modification can be made for ALL bodies\
 , come as you are.\nWe'll close out with time for journaling and optional 
 sharing.\nDonation based Event
