SUMMARY:Divine Mother Shakti Activation Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nJoin us at the **Temple of the Awakening 
 Heart** for a lovingly held\, deep energetic transmission designed to awak
 en your innate life force\, dissolve subtle energetic blocks\, and align y
 ou with your highest calling.\n\nThis is a completely passive experience a
 nd requires no effort on the part of participants. Participants in past ce
 remonies have experienced spontaneous bodily movements and mudras (kriyas)
 \, somatic/emotional release\, vocal and light language activations\, feel
 ing the energy coursing through their system\, visionary experiences\, pas
 t life regressions\, visitations from spirit guides and ancestors\, instan
 t manifestations and more.\n\nThis sacred container will be held by a dedi
 cated cohort of six newly initiated female facilitators\, lovingly supervi
 sed by Sàmą Luž. Together\, we weave a high-vibrational field supported
  by the Light of Christ\, Saint Neem Karoli Baba\, the Master Plant Doctor
 s (including Noya Rao\, the "Tree of Light")\, and our star family lineage
 —the Pleiadians\, Arcturians\, and Lyrans.\n\nThere is nothing to do—s
 imply arrive\, surrender\, and open yourself to the grace of the universal
  life force that flows through all things.\n\nPlease bring a comfortable m
 at\, water\, journal\, blanket and eye mask (optional). We advise arriving
  with a light stomach but not starving (last large meal 2.5 hours prior or
  a lighter meal/snack 1.5 hours prior).\n\nLocation: Temple of the Awakeni
 ng Heart\n207 Robinson Cv Rd\, Leicester\, NC 28748\n\nEnergy Exchange: Fr
 ee to attend (you must RSVP with Sàmą Luž and confirm attendance to par
 ticipate\; space is limited)\n\nPlease contact Sàmą Luž with any questi
 ons and to confirm your attendance: 714-743-5677
